Third-party components:

- Initial detector baseline weights originate from the public repository
  HR-DONK/circuit-recognition (MIT); see
  verified_application/weights/baseline_provenance.json for provenance.
  The framework used to train detector weights is Ultralytics, which is
  licensed under AGPL-3.0 and is separate from the repository license.
- OCR models are derived from PaddleOCR (Apache-2.0) via RapidOCR.
